{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSearch"},{"type":"text","value":" method is a hook that returns the current search query parameters as an object for the current location. This hook is useful for accessing the current search string and query parameters in a component."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"usesearch-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useSearch options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSearch"},{"type":"text","value":" hook accepts an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-from-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.from"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The RouteID to match the search query parameters from."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-shouldthrow-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.shouldThrow"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"default: true"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":","},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSearch"},{"type":"text","value":" will not throw an invariant exception in case a match was not found in the currently rendered matches; in this case, it will return "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-select-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.select"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(search: SelectedSearchSchema) => TSelected"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If supplied, this function will be called with the search object and the return value will be returned from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSearch"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-structuralsharing-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.structuralSharing"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guide/render-optimizations.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Render Optimizations guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for more information."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-strict-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.strict"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional - "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"default: true"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":", the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.from"},{"type":"text","value":" option will be ignored and types will be loosened to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Partial<FullSearchSchema>"},{"type":"text","value":" to reflect the shared types of all search query parameters."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"usesearch-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useSearch returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.from"},{"type":"text","value":" is provided, an object of the search query parameters for the current location or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":" if a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" function is provided."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.strict"},{"type":"text","value":" is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":", an object of the search query parameters for the current location or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":" if a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" function is provided."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useSearch } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const search = useSearch({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n  //    ^ FullSearchSchema\n\n  // OR\n\n  const selected = useSearch({\n    from: '/posts/$postId',\n    select: (search) => search.postView,\n  })\n  //    ^ string\n\n  // OR\n\n  const looseSearch = useSearch({ strict: false })\n  //    ^ Partial<FullSearchSchema>\n\n  // ...\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"usesearch-options","text":"useSearch options","level":2},{"id":"opts-from-option","text":"opts.from option","level":3},{"id":"opts-shouldthrow-option","text":"opts.shouldThrow option","level":3},{"id":"opts-select-option","text":"opts.select option","level":3},{"id":"opts-structuralsharing-option","text":"opts.structuralSharing option","level":3},{"id":"opts-strict-option","text":"opts.strict option","level":3},{"id":"usesearch-returns","text":"useSearch returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `useSearch` method is a hook that returns the current search query parameters as an object for the current location. This hook is useful for accessing the current search string and query parameters in a component.\n\n## useSearch options\n\nThe `useSearch` hook accepts an `options` object.\n\n### `opts.from` option\n\n- Type: `string`\n- Required\n- The RouteID to match the search query parameters from.\n\n### `opts.shouldThrow` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- `default: true`\n- If `false`,`useSearch` will not throw an invariant exception in case a match was not found in the currently rendered matches; in this case, it will return `undefined`.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Type: `(search: SelectedSearchSchema) => TSelected`\n- Optional\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the search object and the return value will be returned from `useSearch`.\n\n### `opts.structuralSharing` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by `select`.\n- See the [Render Optimizations guide](../../guide/render-optimizations.md) for more information.\n\n### `opts.strict` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional - `default: true`\n- If `false`, the `opts.from` option will be ignored and types will be loosened to `Partial<FullSearchSchema>` to reflect the shared types of all search query parameters.\n\n## useSearch returns\n\n- If `opts.from` is provided, an object of the search query parameters for the current location or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n- If `opts.strict` is `false`, an object of the search query parameters for the current location or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useSearch } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const search = useSearch({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n  //    ^ FullSearchSchema\n\n  // OR\n\n  const selected = useSearch({\n    from: '/posts/$postId',\n    select: (search) => search.postView,\n  })\n  //    ^ string\n\n  // OR\n\n  const looseSearch = useSearch({ strict: false })\n  //    ^ Partial<FullSearchSchema>\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useSearchHook\ntitle: useSearch hook\n---\n\nThe `useSearch` method is a hook that returns the current search query parameters as an object for the current location. This hook is useful for accessing the current search string and query parameters in a component.\n\n## useSearch options\n\nThe `useSearch` hook accepts an `options` object.\n\n### `opts.from` option\n\n- Type: `string`\n- Required\n- The RouteID to match the search query parameters from.\n\n### `opts.shouldThrow` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- `default: true`\n- If `false`,`useSearch` will not throw an invariant exception in case a match was not found in the currently rendered matches; in this case, it will return `undefined`.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Type: `(search: SelectedSearchSchema) => TSelected`\n- Optional\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the search object and the return value will be returned from `useSearch`.\n\n### `opts.structuralSharing` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by `select`.\n- See the [Render Optimizations guide](../../guide/render-optimizations.md) for more information.\n\n### `opts.strict` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional - `default: true`\n- If `false`, the `opts.from` option will be ignored and types will be loosened to `Partial<FullSearchSchema>` to reflect the shared types of all search query parameters.\n\n## useSearch returns\n\n- If `opts.from` is provided, an object of the search query parameters for the current location or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n- If `opts.strict` is `false`, an object of the search query parameters for the current location or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useSearch } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const search = useSearch({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n  //    ^ FullSearchSchema\n\n  // OR\n\n  const selected = useSearch({\n    from: '/posts/$postId',\n    select: (search) => search.postView,\n  })\n  //    ^ string\n\n  // OR\n\n  const looseSearch = useSearch({ strict: false })\n  //    ^ Partial<FullSearchSchema>\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n"}
